.TH DANBY-SPACEYOYO 1
.SH NAME
danby-spaceyoyo \- rigid-tether satellite de-spin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/spaceyoyo
.SH MODEL
Radially deploying tip masses increase rotational inertia and reduce satellite
spin under angular-momentum conservation. Spin and deployment are plotted.
